    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zakon is an arcade-flight game with an emphasis on fighting big monsters in a future soviet future-punk Krasnogorie. You play as the new police division, make sure to protect the city from the inside and outside enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GLORY TO THE MOTHERLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zakon is set in the country of Krasnogorie. 80 years ago, when yet another great war was over, the country was on its lowest point it has ever been to. Thank to the supreme Vozhd, Krasnogorie got many reforms to bring back the old glory. Now, with the extremely industrialized world, Krasnogorie stands among other countries with its home-made technologies. Or at least that what everybody says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story begins exactly 80 years after the war. You play as a new police force, displaying the newest jet on a parade of the Victory. However, it seems like the social tension has been rising increasingly fast after the incorporation of the social score in the citizen's life. You will have to do something about the protestors....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an atmospheric take on the soviet-future-punk, with all the political propaganda, technological weapons, and your place in this story with the non-linear story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight big monsters in a high-density city </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your social score to become a respected citizen and to get all benefits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread the VOZD's voice across Molegrad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate any protests and rebellions in order to maintain security of the country</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro PS1 inspired graphics </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zakon is an arcade-flight game with an emphasis on fighting big monsters in a future soviet future-punk Krasnogorie. You play as the new police division, make sure to protect the city from the inside and outside enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/e6f196b195ba901563394633c28bba00.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GLORY TO THE MOTHERLAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zakon is set in the country of Krasnogorie. 80 years ago, when yet another great war was over, the country was on its lowest point it has ever been to. Thank to the supreme Vozhd, Krasnogorie got many reforms to bring back the old glory. Now, with the extremely industrialized world, Krasnogorie stands among other countries with its home-made technologies. Or at least that what everybody says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story begins exactly 80 years after the war. You play as a new police force, displaying the newest jet on a parade of the Victory. However, it seems like the social tension has been rising increasingly fast after the incorporation of the social score in the citizen's life. You will have to do something about the protestors....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/083d3e778696b1e28271454bcbe04ef4.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover an atmospheric take on the soviet-future-punk, with all the political propaganda, technological weapons, and your place in this story with the non-linear story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.poster.avif?t=1748005374\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.webm?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1918120/extras/8f9afd834f630961bbdb83f3626fc709.mp4?t=1748005374\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight big monsters in a high-density city </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase your social score to become a respected citizen and to get all benefits. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spread the VOZD's voice across Molegrad </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Eliminate any protests and rebellions in order to maintain security of the country</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find all upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro PS1 inspired graphics </p></li></ul>",
